# What the Retrobox variant adds to the base: the window manager and what the
# session needs. retrobox-core, retrobox-emulationstation, retrobox-mangohud
# and retrobox-overlay come from their own releases (config/releases) and bring
# their dependencies with them; recommended packages are not installed, so the
# ones Retrobox needs to look right are listed here.

openbox
xterm

# Fonts for EmulationStation and its menus, and the keep-the-screen-on hook
fontconfig
fonts-dejavu-core
python3-jeepney
